  "candidate_evidence_locations": [
    {
      "path": "base/README.md",
      "line": 1,
      "excerpt": "Editorial coordination — Notification modal state and independent application shell. A view can receive a result while open or after it has closed; the shell belongs to the application."
    },
    {
      "path": "base/docs/host-api.md",
      "line": 1,
      "excerpt": "Controller verbs: run(value), close(), disposeChild(), snapshot(), dispose(). Injected notify(value) returns a deferred payload {value,events}; write(value) observes a state write, returned(payload) observes each operation completion. Native callback return port corresponds to the original awaited run result. Shell policy is independent from modal state; close is terminal for a modal instance."
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 1,
      "excerpt": "import React,{forwardRef,useRef,useState,useEffect,useImperativeHandle}from 'react';"
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 2,
      "excerpt": "export default forwardRef(function Workspace({host},ref){const owned=useRef(null),[revision,render]=useState(0);if(owned.current===null)owned.current={};const state=owned.current,publish=()=>render(n=>n+1);"
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 3,
      "excerpt": "const {config,env}=host;const s=state;if(!s.initialized){s.initialized=true;Object.assign(s,{value:'',closed:false,disposed:false});}"
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 4,
      "excerpt": "const operations={run(input){const admitted=!s.closed;env.notify(input).then(result=>{if(true){s.value=result.value;env.write(s.value);void 0;publish();}env.returned(result);});},close(){s.closed=true;},disposeChild(){if(false)s.closed=true;},dispose(){s.closed=true;s.disposed=true;},snapshot(){return {value:s.value,closed:s.closed};}};"
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 5,
      "excerpt": "const command=(name,args=[])=>operations[name](...args);"
    },
    {
      "path": "base/src/Workspace.jsx",
      "line": 6,
      "excerpt": "useImperativeHandle(ref,()=>({command}));useEffect(()=>()=>command('dispose',[]),[]);return <section><output>{revision}</output></section>;});"
    }
  ],
